 an echo of the greatest warrior who ever lived, are the last defense against Suffering, a force made of humanity's worst crimes. You lead them as an army in turn-based tactical battles governed by a Dynamic Timeline System, where actions and counters can be chained into elaborate sequences, and where bosses drawn from Suffering itself bring the toughest fights.\n\nLosses are part of the design. Between battles you can sacrifice one Daughter to heal another, and survivors become stronger for the next fight. Lightbulb Crew's dark, gothic game is single-player with full controller support, and it suits tactics fans who can accept failing and rebuilding."}}